        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG103-201-P22 Contemporary Black Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI-SIG103-201-P22 Samurai leverset comes with a matte black finish. Its sleek design pared with the popular modern black finish make it a stunning choice for contemporary homes. This contemporary black door lever is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and is adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG103-Specififcations.gif?v=1704354645\" width=\"600\" height=\"152\" border=\"0\" atl=\"AHI SIG103 Stainless Steel Lever Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!--- <p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG103B-specifications.gif?v=1704354773\" width=\"440\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" atl=\"AHI SIG103 Specifications\">\r\n</p> --->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/140-mm-stainless-steel-sapporo-leverset-ahi-sig103\"><b>AHI SIG103 in Satin Stainless Steel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Samurai Contemporary Black Door Levers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or light commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI SIG103-201-P22 Contemporary Black Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\" (140 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 3/4\" (19 mm) Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 5/16\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG103B-specifications.pdf?v=1691093351\"><b>AHI SIG103/622 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
